/FocusLink/node_modules/
# 根级 node_modules 也必须忽略。此前只写了 `/FocusLink/node_modules/`，
# 于是仓库根的 `node_modules/.vite/` 会出现在 `git status` 里并被误暂存
# （本轮实测：`git add -A` 把它带进了暂存区）。
/node_modules/
/FocusLink/dist/
/FocusLink/dist-electron/
/FocusLink/dist-selftest/
/FocusLink/dist-mobile/
/FocusLink/dist-cloud/
/FocusLink/.tmp/
/.tmp/
/FocusLink/.wrangler/
/FocusLink/.visual-dist*/
/FocusLink/.visual-review-*/
/FocusLink/NVIDIA Corporation/
release/
# Versioned release-v*/ directories are the reproducible delivery record. Their
# two LFS executables, SHA256SUMS.txt and RELEASE_NOTES.md must remain visible.
/release-v*/win-unpacked/
/release-v*/builder-debug.yml
/release-v*/*.blockmap
# Unpacked Electron runtimes left behind by interrupted or renamed builds.
# 这三条覆盖 `win-unpacked.tmp` 之类的临时解包目录（实测 release-v131、
# release-v131-win、release-v131b 下各有一份，共 700+ 个 Electron 运行时文件）。
# 此前只忽略 `/release-v*/win-unpacked/`，因此它们会出现在 `git status` 里被误提交。
/release-v*/*-unpacked*/
/release-v*/*.tmp/
/visual-unpacked-v*/
*.log
.env
.env.local
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
focuslink-data/
/FocusLink/test-data/
/FocusLink/*-result.json
.DS_Store
design-pack/

# 本地工具的记忆/工作目录，不属于产品源码。
/.workbuddy/

# design workshop assets
/test-data/
/.wrangler/

# 2026-09-28：发布产物不再进 Git（见 .gitattributes 顶部说明）。
# 每个 EXE 约 200MB，走 LFS 会吃满 GitHub 配额并阻断所有推送；
# 发布产物只作为 GitHub Releases 附件分发，本地目录保留但不再跟踪。
release-v*/*.exe
release-v*/win-unpacked/
